  "description": "Create adorable spring-inspired illustrations effortlessly with this set of 12 Spring Procreate Brushes, designed especially for artists, designers, and creators who love cute seasonal artwork. This brush set includes charming spring-themed stamps such as flowers, animals, rain elements, and seasonal accessories — perfect for adding instant personality and warmth to your digital artwork.\nWhether you’re designing for Valentine’s projects, spring crafts, Easter designs, greeting cards, or social media graphics, these brushes help you speed up your workflow while keeping your artwork consistent and professional. Each brush is optimized for Procreate, allowing smooth stamping and easy resizing without losing quality.\nTo make your creative process even easier, a free coordinated colour palette is included so you can start illustrating right away with beautifully matched spring tones.\nPerfect for beginners and professional illustrators alike, these brushes are ideal for creating cute, soft, and playful designs that stand out in digital and print projects.\n⸻\nWhat You Can Make With This Item\n\t•\tValentine’s cards and love-themed illustrations\n\t•\tSpring and Easter greeting cards\n\t•\tCute children’s illustrations\n\t•\tStickers and sticker sheets\n\t•\tPrintable wall art\n\t•\tDigital planners and journals\n\t•\tSocial media graphics and posts\n\t•\tNursery artwork and baby designs\n\t•\tScrapbooking elements\n\t•\tPattern designs and seamless repeats\n\t•\tSublimation designs\n\t•\tInvitations and seasonal stationery\n⸻\nWhat’s Included\n\t•\t12 Spring Procreate Stamp Brushes (.brushset file)\n\t•\tFree Spring Colour Palette (.swatches file)\n\t•\tInstant digital download\n\t•\tCompatible with Procreate app on iPad\n\t•\tInstallation instructions included",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Create adorable spring-inspired illustrations effortlessly with this set of 12 Spring Procreate Brushes, designed especially for artists, designers, and creators who love cute seasonal artwork. This brush set includes charming spring-themed stamps such as flowers, animals, rain elements, and seasonal accessories — perfect for adding instant personality and warmth to your digital artwork.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing for Valentine’s projects, spring crafts, Easter designs, greeting cards, or social media graphics, these brushes help you speed up your workflow while keeping your artwork consistent and professional. Each brush is optimized for Procreate, allowing smooth stamping and easy resizing without losing quality.</p>\n<p>To make your creative process even easier, a free coordinated colour palette is included so you can start illustrating right away with beautifully matched spring tones.</p>\n<p>Perfect for beginners and professional illustrators alike, these brushes are ideal for creating cute, soft, and playful designs that stand out in digital and print projects.</p>\n<p>⸻</p>\n<p>What You Can Make With This Item<br>\n\t•\tValentine’s cards and love-themed illustrations<br>\n\t•\tSpring and Easter greeting cards<br>\n\t•\tCute children’s illustrations<br>\n\t•\tStickers and sticker sheets<br>\n\t•\tPrintable wall art<br>\n\t•\tDigital planners and journals<br>\n\t•\tSocial media graphics and posts<br>\n\t•\tNursery artwork and baby designs<br>\n\t•\tScrapbooking elements<br>\n\t•\tPattern designs and seamless repeats<br>\n\t•\tSublimation designs<br>\n\t•\tInvitations and seasonal stationery</p>\n<p>⸻</p>\n<p>What’s Included<br>\n\t•\t12 Spring Procreate Stamp Brushes (.brushset file)<br>\n\t•\tFree Spring Colour Palette (.swatches file)<br>\n\t•\tInstant digital download<br>\n\t•\tCompatible with Procreate app on iPad<br>\n\t•\tInstallation instructions included</p>",
